    <h1 class="reveal">Print on Demand vs Dropshipping: Which to Start With</h1>
    <p class="sub reveal">Both let you sell without touching a box. Only one of them is safe to learn on.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta reveal"><span>12 Min Read</span><span class="b"></span><span>Updated 2026</span><span class="b"></span><span>The Digital Income Edit™ Editorial</span></div>
  </header>

